#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:73
#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:80
